### D. HOTEL PERFORMANCE INDICATORS

Calculate:

1. Occupancy Percentage.
2. Average Daily Rate (ADR).
3. Revenue per Available Room (RevPAR).
4. Revenue per Occupied Room.
5. Total Revenue per Available Room (TRevPAR).
6. Gross Operating Profit (GOP).
