For example:

Occupancy = Occupied Sellable Rooms ÷ Available Sellable Rooms × 100.

ADR = Room Revenue ÷ Rooms Sold.

RevPAR = Room Revenue ÷ Available Sellable Rooms.

GOPPAR = Gross Operating Profit ÷ Available Sellable Rooms.

